This repository includes and adapts material from dbt Labs' jaffle_shop_duckdb
project (https://github.com/dbt-labs/jaffle_shop_duckdb), recorded at commit
20cc904370818ceab08cf19f8fd196e9e81def88. The reused material is in
analytics/template/, including the original customer, order, and payment seeds
